# Tests hash the contents of checked-in configuration files (for example
# osquery/config/tests/config_tests.cpp hashes
# tools/tests/configs/test_parse_items.conf), so their bytes must be
# identical on every platform. Force LF on checkout regardless of the
# user's core.autocrlf setting; without this, a default Windows clone
# (core.autocrlf=true) checks out CRLF and the hash assertions fail (#8532).
*.conf text eol=lf
